{"id":"steam-1356940","steam":1356940,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Cloud Rack","summary":"A chivalrous man came to the mountain full of secret rumors to explore the truth, overcome all kinds of difficulties, meet all kinds of characters, and uncover the unknown secrets.","about":"Cloud Rack is a traditional 2D action adventure game. The game world is interlinked. Explore deep caves, ancient forests and dangerous tombs, fight with bewitched creatures, get to know friendly and strange characters, and go deep into the mountains to uncover the truth of the mystery.\r\n\r\n\r\nGame features\r\n\r\nClassic horizontal scroll game level.\r\n\r\nConsistent and compact 2D control: Dodge attacks, sprint forward, and use easy kungfu to defeat deadly enemies.\r\n\r\nExplore the interlinked world and shuttle between forgotten mountain paths, overgrown wastelands and abandoned tombs.\r\n\r\nMake your own adventure! Strange mountain is a vast world, you can freely choose the way forward and the enemy you face.\r\n\r\nGet new weapons! Improve your skills, jump on the wall, dodge and block in the battle, return the long-range attack, and launch powerful killing skills to the enemy!\r\n\r\nStylized and abstract characters, funny, silly and cute.\r\n\r\nMore than 50 enemies, 10 epic bosses. Face fierce monsters on the road and conquer powerful kung fu masters.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356940/library_600x900.jpg?t=1700964329","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356940/header.jpg?t=1700964329","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356940/library_hero.jpg?t=1700964329","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356940/header.jpg?t=1700964329","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356940/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1700964329","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.